        "text": "Racials shown in the BlizzCon demo: Walk on Air (glide downward for 10 seconds), Read Ley Line (100% health and mana regeneration for 15 seconds), Wind Blessed (1% haste), Elemental Insight (5% damage to Elementals). Skyborne choose Horde or Alliance at creation.",
